  "job_B1.4.22_20251001_193236": {
    "chunk_text": "leafful witega, abbacuc gehaten, se h\u00e6fde rifteras abedene to his corne, Him com \u00fea fleogende to f\u00e6rlice godes engel, and het beran \u00feone mete to babilonian hra\u00fee, and syllan \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se abbacuc to \u00feam engle \u00feuss: la, leof, ic ne geseah \u00fea burh \u00fee \u00feu segst ne ic nat \u00feone sea\u00f0, \u00dea gel\u00e6hte se engel abbacuc be \u00feam feaxe, and b\u00e6r hine swiftlice to \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan byrig and to \u00d0a clypode abbacuc to \u00feam o\u00ferum witegan, \u00f0u godes mann danihel, nim \u00feisne mete \u00fee to \u00fee \u00fee god And he sona andwyrde, eala \u00feu min god, \u00feu w\u00e6re min gemyndig, and \u00feu ne forl\u00e6tst \u00fea \u00fee lufia\u00f0 \u00fee. And he \u00e6t sona of \u00fe\u00e6re godes sande, and se engel ardlice eft abbacuc ferode to his lande ongean ofer Eft \u00fea on \u00feone seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6g eode se cyning sarig to \u00feam sea\u00f0e, and beseah into. \u00dea efne s\u00e6t danihel ansund betwux \u00feam deorum. \u00dea clypode se cyning, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feuss to gode: eala \u00feu drihten god \u00fee danihel on belyf\u00f0, mycel eart \u00feu And he het his menn sona upp ateon danihel of \u00fe\u00e6ra deora sea\u00f0e. He het \u00fea in awurpan \u00fee hine \u00e6r forwregdon, and hi wurdon abitene on anre beorhthwile \u00e6tforan \u00feam Feala we mihton secgan be swilcum leasum godum, hu bysmorfulle hi w\u00e6ron and heora biggengon Hw\u00e6t \u00fea u",
